==Battleground==
*1 [[Gabriel]] spawns after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
*1 [[Gabriel]] spawns after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*1 [[Gabriel]] spawns after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.
*1 [[Gabriel]] spawns after 43.33 seconds<sup>1,300f</sup>.
*1 [[Heavenly Hippoe]] spawns after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Emilia & Doge]] spawns as the boss.
**8 [[Gabriel]]s spawn, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
**5 [[Heavenly Hippoe]]s spawn, delay 16.67~20 seconds<sup>500f~600f</sup>.
**3 [[Angelic Gory|Angelic Gories]] spawn, delay 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>.

==Strategy==
[[Rocker Cat (Rare Cat)|Artist Cat]], if you have him, can be a massive help here due to his massive defense against [[:Category:Angel Enemies|Angel]] enemies. [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Bahamut Cat]] can also help a lot against the Angelic Gories and Emilia & Doge.

To put it simple, spawn meatshields and summon Bahamut when the boss comes out and you have enough money.

